WEBVTT

00:00:55.530 --> 00:01:02.066
the burning of 100 million
barrels of oil every 24 hours

00:01:02.090 --> 00:01:04.996
and the extraction behind that oil,

00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:07.706
the fumes choking our cities,

00:01:07.730 --> 00:01:10.846
the greenhouse gases
going up in the atmosphere

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:13.346
and overheating our planet.

00:01:13.370 --> 00:01:15.496
None of that is normal,

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:17.796
nor is air pollution,

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:22.276
which can shorten life expectancy
by up to 10 years,

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:24.376
depending on where you live.

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:28.266
This is also a matter
of environmental justice

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:31.521
because air pollution hurts everyone,